      "side": 1,
      "message": "Priority queue doesn\u0027t have the de-duplicating property that is needed for the algorithm. I can\u0027t see if a remove or a cross for the event point already exists in the queue using std::priority_queue. A balanced tree is the recommended data structure in the papers. But, I think it will be easy to change. Having the EventQueue API allows us to change the data structure to what ever we want when we know better.",
